The hostnames are updated through the update endpoint of No-IP
(https://www.noip.com/integrate/request), with the No-IP account or the DDNS
Key each user enters. The public address of the home is read on the public
echo services ipify (https://www.ipify.org), icanhazip (https://icanhazip.com)
and ident.me (https://ident.me), which only see the address a request comes
from.

